      <bpmn:userTask id="W4295_Task5" name="Pricing/Finance determine bulky cost-to-serve by zone/category (vehicle, crew…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Pricing/Finance determine bulky cost-to-serve by zone/category (vehicle, crew, install, haul-away, recycle, failed-window cost) and set zone-tiered delivery fees and free-delivery thresholds, aligned to VS-118
Responsible (R): Pricing / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO / CMO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4295_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4295_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
