        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Pricing/Merchandising set install-fee, haul-away-fee, and bundle incentives (free install with appliance bundle) to drive attach without margin leak, aligned to VS-14/VS-58
Responsible (R): Pricing / Merchandising
Accountable (A): CFO / CMO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4295_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4295_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4295_Task7" name="Revenue Assurance/Pricing monitor fee recovery vs cost-to-serve, detect leakage…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Revenue Assurance/Pricing monitor fee recovery vs cost-to-serve, detect leakage (override, under-charge), and tune thresholds
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance / Pricing
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4295_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
