    <bpmn:process id="W_W4296" name="W4296. Bulky Delivery Service-Level, Capacity Analytics &amp; Peak (Ber-Month) Planning" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Operating performance; peak season planning; SLA review
Frequency: Monthly review + annual peak plan
Volume: Enterprise bulky-delivery performance + capacity utilization
Owner: Bulky-Delivery Operations / Logistics Analytics (VS-06) / Finance (VS-17.4)
Participants: DC Ops (VS-04), Store Ops (VS-07), 3PL (VS-56), CX (VS-13), HSE (VS-24)
Source: workflow W4296 — Bulky Delivery Service-Level, Capacity Analytics &amp; Peak (Ber-Month) Planning</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4296_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4296_Lane1" name="Delivery Ops">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4296_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4296_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4296_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4296_Lane2" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4296_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4296_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4296_Start4" name="Operating performance; peak season planning; SLA review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4296_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4296_Task5" name="Delivery Ops/Analytics track SLA KPIs (on-time-window %, first-time-success %…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Delivery Ops/Analytics track SLA KPIs (on-time-window %, first-time-success %, install-complete %, failed-window %, damage-on-delivery %, haul-away completion %) and crew/vehicle utilization vs plan
Responsible (R): Delivery Ops / Analytics
Accountable (A): Head of Bulky Delivery
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4296_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4296_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4296_Task6" name="Delivery Ops/Commercial run the annual peak plan (summer AC, ber-month…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Delivery Ops/Commercial run the annual peak plan (summer AC, ber-month furniture/appliance) — pre-book 3PL flex, pre-position stock at serving DCs, extend crew shifts within DOLE limits
Responsible (R): Delivery Ops / Commercial / DC Ops
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4296_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4296_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4296_Task7" name="Finance/CX review cost-per-delivery, NPS for delivered orders, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance/CX review cost-per-delivery, NPS for delivered orders, and recovery/refund from failed/damaged deliveries, and feed improvement actions to W4297–W4312
Responsible (R): Finance / CX / Delivery Ops
Accountable (A): CFO / COO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4296_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4296_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4296_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4296_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-659 (ensure controlled execution — Bulky/White-Goods Delivery Network, Scheduling &amp; Capacity (PA-143.1).) | - CTL-659: SLA monitored monthly; peak plan approved; failed/damaged deliveries reviewed &amp; recovered
Owner: Bulky-Delivery Operations / Logistics Analytics (VS-06) / Finance (VS-17.4)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
